Mode B run of the Probity reader (probityai/agent-evidence-vectors at 52403f6, interop/agentavow-signed-map-v1/map_reader.py, by Sankalp Gilda) over the pinned v1-annotations vector file, operated by aeoess (executed by Claude under his mandate, 2026-10-13). The reader's own runner is locked to the v1 packet, so harness.py passes this packet to the reader's functions and compares their output with the expected values, deciding nothing itself. report.json is its verbatim stdout (exit 0, empty stderr). provenance.json states the runner, inputs, label basis, covered and uncovered claims, and limits. SHA256SUMS.txt covers the other four files.
